      "post_subject": "My Entry to PCG",
      "content_md": "Only a year and a half late, here's my entry to the Porcelain Cat Group:\n\n![Image](http://home.comcast.net/~stampydoo/japanese_cat_2.jpg)\n\nThe subject is a genuine porcelain cat, purchased from Japan (in Epcot!). It came complete with polarized gold coating! \n\nThis is a Denisyuk hologram on BB-640 (2.5 x 2.5 plate). 11 mw Hene, 6 second exposure, JD-4 processing with no post-treatment. Illumination is from hydrogen fission heated helium incandescent source at a distance of 93,000,000 miles. (give or take).\n\nThis is why I like BB!",
      "signature": "",
